WEBVTT

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:19.560
<i>~Bond of the Underworld~</i>

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:41.700
Episode 2
Seeing Is Believing

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:39.990
Ki didn't pick on anyone.

00:01:39.990 --> 00:01:42.180
Maybe your children were 
the ones messing with him?

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.460
How dare you! Are you saying 
you saw what happened?

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:46.870
Look out!

00:01:57.050 --> 00:01:59.510
This is a very unusual rejection.

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:04.620
Ma'am, why didn't you tell us that 
his body would reject a blood transfusion?

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:07.450
It's a good thing the volume of 
the blood transfusion was low,

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:09.400
but we cannot take responsibility 
if anything happens.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.490
I'm just finding out myself.

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:16.450
What a weak child.

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:19.740
Do you think I'll pay his medical bills
 even though he collapsed on purpose?

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.240
Be careful. Don't pay them anything.

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:35.850
Sen, let's take Ki and move.

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:38.390
Okay.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.700
<i>It was that boy's.</i>

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:58.440
<i>He might one day regain a 
human form, if you wear this.</i>

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:03.160
<i>Will I be able to see him again someday?</i>

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.910
You Keika!

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:08.870
You promised you'd be my partner!

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:12.370
Tanmoku Ki is next door. If he 
hears us, your image will be ruined.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:12.960
Don't care.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.460
He won't fall for me anyway.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:22.220
<i>The old lady fidgeting with her 
toes is Tanmoku Ki's fiancée.</i>

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:25.300
<i>She wants to be accepted as his wife, 
so she had been hiding her true nature.</i>

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:29.140
<i>She seems to have given up, believing 
that I've deprived her of her wife position.</i>

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:33.770
I was instantly killed again!

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:36.440
I haven't beaten it once yet!

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.410
Are you going to help me or not?!

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:41.650
Talismans?

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.070
Did you make them?

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.930
It's my homework from the red-headed jerk.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.990
Damn it. I can't believe I'm getting 
stuck with homework even when I'm dead.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.000
You really suck at this.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.330
They totally look like they 
were written by a ghost.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:55.210
Shut up.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:59.000
Look, you make talismans like this.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.710
You're really good at making talismans.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.190
Ta-dah!

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:17.690
Tanmoku Ki is gay

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:17.690
Hey, why is this word in English?

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.400
What does this mean?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.690
You really are stupid.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:24.770
G-A-Y. It's read as "gay."

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:27.270
It means, "You are god."

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:31.810
Long ago, they used to write 
from right to left in Europe, too.

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:38.790
So before the 15th century, "G-A-Y" 
represented the meaning "You are god."

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.900
Basically, it's a word with god's protection.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.570
Ghosts come from all around the world now.

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.180
This talisman is essential to Tanmoku Ki.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.930
You have to protect him from Western ghosts.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.770
<i>Tanmoku Ki is g-a-y.</i>

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.950
<i>He certainly is almost god-like.</i>

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.230
I'll make a bunch then.

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:05.250
If I put them all around the mansion, 
Western ghosts won't be able to get close.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.670
What a great idea!

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:16.750
You really care about Tanmoku-san.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.210
<i>You can fool an idiot even 
when they're a spirit.</i>

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.850
<i>I can't wait to see how 
Tanmoku-san punishes him.</i>

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.850
You Keika, what are you writing?

00:05:30.170 --> 00:05:32.350
Look, I made this for you.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:36.210
What do you think?

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:41.620
You're not used to Western ghosts, so
I made a bunch of these for self-defense.

00:05:41.620 --> 00:05:45.690
In this country, you're the Youmeishi, 
and in other countries you're gay.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.240
Don't be ridiculous!

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.950
Both of you, come with me.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.780
Wait, Tanmoku-san!

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:00.380
Flat-out refusing my kindness...

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.460
Doesn't he want to be a god? Arrogant jerk.

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:16.030
You're taking me shopping?

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.020
Yeah.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.810
Yay!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:25.150
These are really nice, as are these.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.400
This bag is great, too.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:32.410
I'm surprised. Even you go window shopping.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:35.870
Today is probably the first and last time

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:41.080
we'll be able to celebrate 
her birthday together.

00:06:44.690 --> 00:06:47.090
This one is nice, and so is this one.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:49.040
What do I do? I want them all.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.390
It's your birthday, so why don't 
you splurge and buy them all?

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:56.520
You Keika, don't go peeping just 
because you're a spirit! Get out!

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:59.940
Huh? How did you know it's my birthday?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:02.310
Tanmoku Ki told me.

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:06.440
He remembered my birthday?

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:08.690
Thank you very much.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:11.370
But I haven't paid...

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:16.610
Everything you buy is being 
paid for by Tanmoku-sama.

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:25.290
<i>Damn it. Rich guys can 
captivate women like that.</i>

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:26.810
Does this look good on me?

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:28.170
More or less.

00:07:29.100 --> 00:07:30.040
What about this one?

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.220
More or less.

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.500
Those two look like models.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:38.050
They're so beautiful.
 I'm gonna take a picture.

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:43.220
<i>The three of us are walking together, 
but no one can see me.</i>

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:46.000
Let's go. Come on, can we?

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:46.770
Sure.

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:48.790
I'm so excited!

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:37.990
<i>Mr. Spirit Shadow...</i>

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:39.890
<i>Mr. Spirit Shadow!</i>

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:45.660
<i>Stone boy?</i>

00:08:56.140 --> 00:09:00.060
If this were a real fight, you'd be dead.

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.990
Damn fox! Surprise attacks are unfair!

00:09:02.990 --> 00:09:04.560
Besides, I'm already dead!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.020
Trying to get out of my lessons?

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:12.050
Lecture by Mr. In

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.060
This time I'll scatter your soul.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:12.460
Your pathetic punch didn't even hurt.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:14.070
It didn't hurt?

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.790
That's right. It didn't affect me at all.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:18.530
Try hitting me again.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:22.240
Could it be a pact connection?

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:24.110
That's what it is.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.780
I shared my soul and power with Tanmoku Ki.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:30.750
Don't make me angry.
 I'm absolutely invincible right now.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.170
You Keika, listen to me.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:37.510
As my student, you're not allowed 
to lose to anyone but me.

00:09:38.460 --> 00:09:42.040
Avoid battles you can't win, and 
if you can't avoid them, run away.

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.390
Ignore anyone who picks a fight.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.770
Anyway, just make sure to protect yourself.

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:48.950
Th-That's sneaky.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:51.070
That's a weak lesson.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:56.900
What kind of lesson is that? 
Telling me to run from a fight I can't win.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.060
I'm going home.

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:13.590
Are you serious?

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:16.770
It's so he can't be oppressed.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:25.890
That's not the real pact connection.
 What the hell is it?

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:38.610
Even if you recover quickly, 
don't just throw your life away!

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.150
You won't recover from
 the damage you receive.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.620
One day, you won't be able 
to endure it anymore!

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:48.620
As long as you don't raise a hand to him,
 there won't be any effect on me.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.030
Are you mocking me?

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:58.590
If he gets stronger, there will 
be nothing to worry about.

00:11:01.180 --> 00:11:04.090
Don't tell him about this.

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.980
You're still mine.

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:16.630
<i>Keika, get stronger.</i>

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:18.190
<b>Forbidden Spells   Spirit Bondage</b>

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:21.850
My son didn't pick on anyone.

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:23.590
What do you mean by "youkai"?

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:25.340
My son is different.

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:29.160
<i>Mr. Spirit Shadow. Mr. Spirit Shadow!</i>

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:31.290
Stone boy!

00:11:34.050 --> 00:11:35.470
<i>What are you doing?</i>

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:39.760
I heard stone boy's voice. I saw him, too!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:43.110
<i>I can't feel any spiritual 
energy from that stone.</i>

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:47.200
<i>Besides, it would take decades 
for him to regain human form.</i>

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:49.430
I really saw him. I'm not lying.

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:56.190
I would know since this is always hanging 
from my neck and I treasure it every day.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.900
<i>Knock it off.</i>

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.610
You're always like this.

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:03.930
No matter how much you try 
to cram, you need time off!

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:07.160
You're always cooped up at 
home or studying at school.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:11.930
You'll go crazy if you don't go out 
and enjoy the beauty of nature!

00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:13.950
That's why you can't feel the stone boy.

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:15.960
You'll turn into a dried-out 
husk at this rate.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:19.000
Get out!

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:23.980
We're in the middle of class.

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.850
After I went through all that trouble 
to stick my talisman on him,

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:39.590
he gets pissed instead of 
being grateful. He's so mean!

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.780
Ouch!

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:45.260
I'm sorry, are you okay?

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.490
Are you a student here?

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:52.410
I'm in training here as a student teacher.

00:12:53.650 --> 00:12:55.210
<i>She can see me?</i>

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:57.220
Huh?

00:12:58.470 --> 00:13:00.720
Where's my pendant? I just had it.

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:01.770
Pendant?

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:05.190
It's a green, square stone and 
it's very precious to me.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:06.930
Oh, is that it?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.460
A stone spirit?

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:14.100
Yeah. Weird, huh?

00:13:14.100 --> 00:13:15.450
Not at all.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:17.730
They appear a lot in folktales, right?

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:21.240
The world is a big place.
 Mysterious things are likely to happen.

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:25.110
But what kind of relationship 
do you have with that spirit?

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.800
Nothing special, it's just...

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:32.630
he reminded me of someone I used to know, 
but who I haven't seen in a long time.

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:47.610
Are you interested in that student teacher?

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:50.810
Wait, were you watching us?

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:53.560
Still hitting on girls, even when you're dead.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:56.430
I never meet decent girls when I'm with you!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.190
They're all too extreme!

00:13:58.190 --> 00:13:59.060
A transvestite.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:00.310
A savage woman.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:05.570
I've finally met a normal girl who can see me. 
What's so wrong about enjoying that?

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:08.710
Spirits can't get involved 
with humans anyway.

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:10.820
I have something I want to ask you.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.590
You made this, didn't you?

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:34.430
Stupid Tanmoku Ki. 
The nicer I am, the cockier he gets.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.490
I was in class. Were you waiting long?

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:40.690
Goodness, you seem down.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.210
I'm fine.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:46.730
I was roughed up by my boss,
 but I'm a masochist, so I can handle it.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.410
I am not taking that teacher's class anymore.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:55.820
I'm only going to it for the credit.
 What is her deal?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:59.940
Students these days are awful,
 making fun of their teacher like that!

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:00.950
It's fine.

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:03.170
My lessons just aren't that good.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.990
Who said such a thing? I like them!

00:15:05.990 --> 00:15:07.710
R-Really?

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.220
You Keika.

00:15:09.890 --> 00:15:12.540
Class is starting, come on.

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:18.050
You're not going to run me around so easily.

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:20.650
I don't care if you're asking nicely.

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:23.000
When did you start training at this school?

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.560
About six months ago, I guess?

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:26.190
I've never seen you before.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:30.330
Ah, well, that's because your 
attendance rate isn't so good.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.540
I'll talk to you at home.

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:36.030
Whatever you want.

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:40.210
Sheesh, he's a good guy, but kind of weird.

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:44.170
I might not be meant to be a teacher.

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:46.340
Don't say that. I think you are.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:50.570
It's been my dream to teach 
the pleasure of learning.

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:56.350
I left my hometown, studied hard,
and got into a teaching college.

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:00.020
Once my training is over,
 I'll receive my teaching license.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:03.860
Everyone wants to remain 
in the city, but not me.

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:07.770
I'm going to go back home since 
there aren't enough teachers there.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:15.030
I want to become a full-fledged teacher 
and teach children, but I keep messing up.

00:16:15.630 --> 00:16:17.450
That's not true. They just doesn't understand.

00:16:18.030 --> 00:16:22.210
The closer you get to others, the more 
I'm sure they will come to understand.

00:16:22.210 --> 00:16:27.000
I don't think they want to talk to me,
 just like Tanmoku-san earlier.

00:16:27.470 --> 00:16:29.750
Then we'll take on that hurdle!

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.980
What is this?

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:37.100
That teacher made them.

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.630
I don't eat food made by others.

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:48.310
You know, that girl has a good 
personality, she's a hard worker,

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:50.780
and she's good at managing things.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:54.940
If she comes by, will you you make 
me look good and talk to her?

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:57.460
I'm sure you'll be friends. 
Isn't that great?

00:16:57.460 --> 00:16:58.870
Are you her middleman now?

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:01.210
Look, here she comes.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.370
We were waiting for you!

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.380
Come here.

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:11.540
Go find somewhere to hide.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:14.670
I'll show you the truth.

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:17.050
The truth?

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:25.020
I'm so sorry I'm late.

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:27.730
I'll go get us some drinks.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:28.940
Be careful.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:36.560
You-kun is taking a while.

00:17:36.560 --> 00:17:40.530
He invited you here so I could make 
friends with one of my students.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:45.350
It's my first time making them, 
and I'm not sure they taste right,

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.290
but do you want to try one?

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:49.540
Sure.

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:03.350
H-How is it? Does it taste good?

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:08.070
Tanmoku-kun?

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:11.730
Tanmoku-kun!

00:18:15.540 --> 00:18:16.810
Tanmoku-kun!

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:29.620
Your spiritual energy is so strong. 
Share it with me, too!

00:18:31.460 --> 00:18:33.670
Trying to take me down with drugs?

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.110
I've been a Youmeishi for ten years.

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:41.060
I've seen many youkai more cowardly than you.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:45.050
Why did you eat it if you 
realized I was a youkai?!

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:47.610
To teach him a lesson.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:51.860
You-kun!

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:56.250
He has to be shown instead of told.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:59.360
Go find somewhere to hide.

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:02.490
I'll show you the truth.

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:07.790
I wasn't lying! There 
are things I want to do.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:11.880
I want to help the kids back 
home. Please, believe me!

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:21.140
I did believe you, but I was wrong.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:24.210
Tanmoku Ki! Can you stand?

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:25.510
I'm all right.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.170
What are you doing?

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:30.090
Wait!

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.740
I'll steal a kiss if you move.

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:42.400
"Student teacher who yearned to 
become a teacher dies in accident."

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:43.920
It's unfortunate.

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:46.700
She was only one step away from her dream.

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:49.740
Even I would be regretful.

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:52.510
And you killed her.

00:19:52.510 --> 00:19:54.210
She was trying to set you up.

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:57.500
Such a weak spirit would 
disappear quickly anyway.

00:19:57.930 --> 00:20:04.140
She used you to try and steal my powers, 
and then I set you up.

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:06.600
I'm the bad guy.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:15.890
Bad spirits want my powers the way 
normal humans want money and influence.

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:17.870
Things outside the barrier are dangerous.

00:20:17.870 --> 00:20:19.230
Now that I think about it,

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:23.910
the girl I met in the red dress 
back then was the same, too.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:27.280
Tanmoku Ki.

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:32.110
Are those who get close to 
you just scheming spirits?

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:36.880
Aren't there any spirits out 
there without ulterior motives?

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:41.030
There are.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:43.900
Right here.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:51.150
No, no, it's not just me! 
The stone boy is the same, too!

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:54.600
He really did gain human form! Look.

00:20:56.570 --> 00:21:01.850
Keika, there's absolutely no way 
to revive someone who has died.

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:05.500
You're just seeing something that 
you yearn for in your heart.

00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.460
It's all your imagination.

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:12.890
I've been trailing Tanmoku Ki 
and You Keika for a few days,

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:16.040
but rather than drifting apart, 
their bond is deepening.

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:21.210
Worry not.

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:26.300
My poison will not fail.

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:29.310
Is it really just my imagination?

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:32.270
Mr. Spirit Shadow.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:33.770
The stone boy?

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:38.270
The Youmeishi is lying.

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:40.520
I'm right here, aren't I?

00:21:48.150 --> 00:21:51.500
You Keika, what are you doing?

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:40.060
Next Episode
Preview

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:28.970
I didn't get to say goodbye.

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:31.970
I am simply showing a strong desire.

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:33.450
I want to protect that boy.

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:37.970
Tanmoku Ki, we will meet again someday...

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Blood-Stained Snow</b>

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:38.810
Keika!

00:23:38.810 --> 00:23:40.270
Preparations are complete.
